// We close everything
await sdb.done();
```

- `columns`: An array of strings representing the names of the columns to be stacked (unpivoted). In the example, this is `["2021", "2022", "2023"]`.
- `columnsTo`: The name of the new column that will contain the original column names (e.g., "Year"). In the example, this is "year".
- `valuesTo`: The name of the new column that will contain the values from the stacked columns (e.g., "Employees"). In the example, this is "employees".

