The `union` method handles only two columns at a time. To union multiple columns, perform successive unions using intermediate columns.

```ts
import { SimpleDB } from "@nshiab/simple-data-analysis";
const sdb = new SimpleDB();
const table = sdb.newTable();
await table.loadGeoData("./my-geodata.geojson");
// First union geomA and geomB into tempUnion
await table.union("geomA", "geomB", "tempUnion");
// Then union tempUnion with geomC into finalUnion
await table.union("tempUnion", "geomC", "finalUnion");
await table.logTable();
await sdb.done();
```

