The documentation does not specify handling of duplicate pivot keys; typically the last value will overwrite earlier ones. To avoid this, ensure each combination of the pivot column and the grouping column is unique before calling `wider`.
```
import { SimpleDB } from "@nshiab/simple-data-analysis";
const sdb = new SimpleDB();
const table = sdb.newTable();
await table.loadData("./employee_counts.csv");
// Ensure uniqueness before pivoting
await table.wider("Year", "Employees");
await table.logTable();
await sdb.done();
```

